<title>USA: Western Digital sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Western Digital sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Digital Corp said Friday its board had approved a two-for-one stock split, payable around June 3, record May 20.</p>
<p>The split will increase the number of shares outstanding to 86 million.</p>
